WEBVTT

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.410
Ugh...

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:21.380
All the money I make goes
straight into Rim's stomach...

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:25.880
How does a monster's appetite work anyway?
It's way too inefficient...

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:39.640
What a pleasant night,
don't you think, Mr. Ninomiya?

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.650
Nights like this truly arouse me.

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:47.690
By the way, how is
your loan repayment going?

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.700
Oh, right, about that...

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:52.780
Five million gold in just interest alone.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:57.540
At this rate, we'd be forced
to exchange your life for money.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.080
If that doesn't sound good to you...

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:05.460
...pay up in full, dirtbag.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:09.340
You have one month
to bring me 5 million gold.

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:45.290
I will never be like my father.

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:53.380
Mr. Ninomiya, I have a lot to say to you
for taking that photo the other day.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:51.000
Episode 4: Crazy Death March

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:57.180
However, I do have a responsibility
to fulfill as someone praised as a hero.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:02:00.890
I will perform my duties no matter what.

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:04.980
Let's redouble our efforts and
really clear out this dungeon! Yeah!

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:06.690
Yeah...

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:12.360
Um, what's wrong with Mr. Ninomiya?

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.990
He's been like this since
this morning for some reason...

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:18.030
One month to repay 5 million gold...

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.490
What?! Hey! Let go!

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:25.080
What you need is energy and spirit.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.750
Don't you remember? I have the photo...

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:32.840
I know. But you're not
opposed to doing work, are you?

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.550
Still, you have to think about efficiency!

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:38.140
You can learn that in the field!

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:40.890
Dammit, this again!

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:45.190
You both are complete amateurs
with no prior combat experience.

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:46.810
Let's start you off here
on the second floor

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:49.440
to get you accustomed
to dungeon exploration.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.650
Follow me.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:55.570
Why does she have to be so
self-important...? Gets on my nerves.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:03:00.740
What's important in dungeon exploration
is to always be focused.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:04.750
You never know what
dangers will appear and when.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:09.040
Being able to maintain your calm
and always making the right decisions,

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:12.590
that is the key to raising
your chance of survival.

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:14.420
Chance of survival...

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:24.310
Let's clear out those monsters
before we move on.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:29.850
Fight | Item
| Money -5 million Gold

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:29.850
3 Horned Wolves Appear!

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:29.850
4 Slimes Appear!

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:29.850
3 Big Worms Appear!

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.310
Dealt 30 damage to Horned Wolf!

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:36.320
Experience is everything!
Go give it your all!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:37.450
No way!

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.080
Ugh... Dirty, dangerous, demeaning... 3Ds!

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.910
Ninomiya! Don't move!

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.790
Good work!

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:50.580
Next, there are parts of a monster's body
that have a high concentration of mana.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.500
For these horned wolves, it's the horn.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:57.130
We collect these and
bring them back to collect a reward.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.220
For reference,
how much is that horn worth?

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.350
Let's see...

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:05.720
I'd say, around 1,500 gold
for the whole stack.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:08.810
Only 1,500 gold?!

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.100
Oh no...

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:14.270
I'll never make
5 million gold at that rate!

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:18.860
Hey, Wanibe, when did your tail grow back?

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.700
Hmm? This grows back right away.

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:24.160
It's easily replaceable,
like us grunt workers...

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.580
That's it!

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:30.000
For the last few months,

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:34.130
there have been signs indicating
that a Death March is imminent.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:37.710
This is extraordinary, since the
regular cycle is once every 10 years.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:43.430
The Death March causes all mined demonite
and defeated monsters to return at once.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:47.390
Obviously, it causes some light damage
but huge revenue for our company.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:48.230
This time--

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:52.860
Wait, are you suited to deal
with such an extraordinary event?

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:59.240
It's nothing compared to the hardships
I dealt with back in my day.

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:02.740
I hear the Majin is expected
to return this time as well!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:07.620
According to recent reports, several
employees were spotted doing something

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:10.960
strange on the second floor...

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:12.790
But that is insignificant.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:16.090
As long as we get through this Death March
safely, there will be no problems.

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:19.970
Everything is going according to my plans.

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:23.510
Just handle it, all right?

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.180
Certainly.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:29.730
I'm sure every employee
will work together with dedication.

