00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:50.370
Welcome to Ninomiya's
Smiley-Town Monster Farm!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:06:26.360
Hot buzz! Ninomiya Farm

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:55.330
Can you believe it? That dull dump of
a dungeon, renovated by artisan ants,

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:59.340
has now become a
grazing area great for kids!

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:02.300
It's barbaric to kill
and loot from monsters.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:04.840
If they are so strong and full of life,

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:08.060
why not just take what we need
and let them heal?

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:14.810
Healing period? It should take them less
than three days to grow everything back.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:14.890
Advisor: Ms. Queen Ant

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:21.820
Monsters that arrive at our farm
receive tender brushing care

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:26.360
Trimmer: Mr. Wanibe

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:21.570
from our dedicated professional groomer.
What a shiny new fur-style!

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:26.530
Thanks to Rim, they're very obedient.

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.580
Petting them lets me forget
about the stress of work.

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:33.040
Even monsters are willing to cooperate
when given a win-win proposition.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:36.500
Seemed more like a threat
to their lives to me.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:42.050
This is Dungeon Black Company's
first business model!

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:46.010
Now that I've paid back my 5 million gold,
everything is going well!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:52.640
This... This isn't right. Easily making
money and doing well, that's...

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.480
That's like...

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:56.230
Earthquake?!

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:57.690
This is...

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.110
Shia!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:13.750
You don't often check resumes
in a place like this.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:19.170
No, but I have to find a new hero quickly.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:22.670
I see... I feel sorry for these heroes.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:28.680
During a Death March, the Majin attacks
humans to recover its lost magic power.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:32.810
The most efficient response is to feed it
someone with a high magic power.

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:39.650
I hope Ms. Shia does her best
to generate revenue for our company...

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:42.820
...as a sacrifice to the Majin.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:55.250
Mr. Ninomiya! You're not doing anything;
why are you being so loud?!

00:07:55.250 --> 00:08:00.710
Shut up! I'm trying my best to not get
thrown off by your superhuman athletics!

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.920
You're exaggerating.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:07.170
That said, I'm glad you tried to save me.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:09.930
Even though your attempt
was a complete and utter failure,

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:13.350
it's good to see that you have a heart.

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:16.600
Sorry I'm a failure.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:22.110
Being all alone out here in the
middle of a horde of monsters is bad.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:24.980
Isn't there like a
"quick exit" type magic item...?

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:25.860
There is.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:27.400
There is?!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:33.450
Yes, but it's very valuable.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:37.870
Why use it in this
totally mundane situation?

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.830
In fact, I'm super
excited to be put in a place

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.920
where doing work is the only way out!

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:46.550
Please take care of
your weird desires elsewhere...

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:57.600
Ugh, another big guy?
Take him out quickly, will ya?

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.270
Shia!

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:08.030
Don't come! It seems to only be after me.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.210
This power... Is it a Majin?

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:37.350
I see... This is why.
This is why I was brought here.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:45.610
Let's pull back for now.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:51.490
Are you all right?

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:56.450
Yes... But the fight
isn't going "all right."

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.330
At best, the Majin and I will both die.

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:02.500
Worst, I'll lose my strength first,
and it'll torture me to death.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.540
What do we do?

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:10.510
Defeating the Majin is my duty.
I must fulfill it.

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:16.850
Let's go home.
You have that returning item, right?

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:19.350
This is no time to be stingy.

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:21.310
We can't.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:25.400
That item can only transport
a single target to the surface.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:30.570
Mr. Ninomiya, go ahead
and leave without me.

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:32.990
You give up way too easily!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:35.950
I owe a great debt to Raiza'ha!

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:39.370
I cannot abandon my duty.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:42.000
So yes, be well, Mr. Ninomiya.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.420
You... You can't...

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:48.340
If you don't like it,
I'll just say you owe me one.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.260
Goodbye...

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:54.930
No!

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:56.140
That's a no!

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.550
Huh?

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:13.070
The demonite has returned.
How is the mining progress?

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:17.700
Well... The dungeon is full of monsters;
we can't mine...

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:22.700
Keep the employees working
until they meet the quota.

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.500
Y-Yes.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.170
This is seriously a Death March...

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.340
Huh?

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:37.430
Hey... Hey!

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:42.470
M-Mr. Ninomiya?!
Do you understand what you just did?!

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:46.850
Of course I do. I sent that
annoying obstacle to the surface.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:49.520
And now you and I have survived.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.480
That's not the point!

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:56.200
Judging from how it behaved,
it's completely locked on to you.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:58.910
It'll surely return to you after a while.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:00.820
Are you saying you bought time?

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.080
Yes.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:06.290
Remember this. I'm not like
the other grunts you see around you!

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:08.710
The one standing here is...

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:11.340
Me, the one and only.

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:13.750
Majin confirmed on the surface!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:17.470
Someone must have used
the transportation magic!

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:20.300
Why is the Majin at the surface?!

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.850
What did you idiots do?!

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:25.180
I-I don't know! We didn't do anything!

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:29.230
The Majin is proceeding to the dungeon,
destroying the surrounding facilities!

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:34.440
Who did such
a despicable foolish thing...?!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:40.360
Hurry! We cannot delay even
a single minute or single second!

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:46.660
Detmolt Majin has destroyed
the seal to the third floor!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:47.870
It's still moving!

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.330
Extreme danger! All workers, please...

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.960
Wha--? Dungeon Master?!

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:53.000
Stop it, no matter what!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:57.630
If it causes any more damage,
I'll subtract it from your pay!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:02.800
Hey! Ninomiya! Where are you?

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.640
Please be safe...

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.890
Oh, Mr. Ant?

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:13.900
Frontline force, get in position!

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:14.980
Have you found Rim?

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.280
Unfortunately...

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:19.450
Where is she when we need her the most?!

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:21.660
Ninomiya!

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:24.240
What took you so long, Wanibe!

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.740
I'm glad you're safe!

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:31.920
But... What are you trying to do out here?

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:34.460
Let me tell you...

00:13:37.550 --> 00:13:40.380
It's what's called a boss fight!

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:45.640
Welcome, Majin! You're finally here!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:50.480
How insolent of you to try
to oppose me, the great Ninomiya!

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:53.150
Now I grant you death!

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:56.230
And goodbye.

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.650
Gotcha!

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.950
Alpha team, begin deploying cement!

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:05.490
Lock the Majin in place!

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:08.450
Shia, time for your magic!

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:19.760
Yes! Magic can dry cement super quickly!

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:22.630
What kind of fighting style is this...?

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:27.010
Or not, oops!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.260
It's still quite energized!

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:31.100
Alpha team, fall back!

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:33.350
Proceed to plan two!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:38.610
Shia, with Rim missing, you're
the greatest tactical asset we have.

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:40.610
However, you're injured...

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:42.860
Y-Yes.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:48.830
I've recovered a little, but I need a bit
more time before I'm at full strength.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:53.500
I want you to get plenty
of rest until we need you.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:58.380
A critical strike can only be dealt
when the timing is perfectly aligned.

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:00.380
--Ninomiya!
--Mr. Ninomiya...

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:06.300
Hey! Why am I like this?!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.260
Make use of anything that's useful!

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:13.600
If you need to rest, you can rest
and be useful at the same time!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.230
Yes, it's catching on real well.

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:19.400
It seems to be very much attached to you.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.480
What terrible phrasing...

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:26.700
It must be extremely hungry
for magic power, for some reason.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:31.290
To defeat it, we need to pump in enough
magic power to kill it in one blow,

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:34.580
or use some sort of
purely physical attack.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.290
With me, nothing is impossible!

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:39.880
Bravo team, begin operation!

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:53.430
The monsters from the farm
are performing better than expected.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:56.520
It's all thanks to your translating,
communications manager.

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:58.560
Extremely delighted to hear that from you.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.610
Now, Wanibe, time for the final touch.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:03.730
Huh? What now?

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:07.450
That goop is flammable.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:13.700
Burn, burn!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.580
Burn to a crisp, leave nothing behind!

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.750
What a terrible way to fight...

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.750
Is that a compliment?

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.720
Watch out!

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:36.770
It's confused and
attacking indiscriminately.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:39.940
This is bad.
The only thing we can do is...

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:46.110
Put your life on the line?
I told you to stop that stuff.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:47.780
Please stop trivializing this!

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:51.370
I just want to fulfill
my duty and destiny.

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:53.370
What's wrong with that?

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:57.790
Your inflexible thinking...

00:16:57.790 --> 00:17:02.880
Is that because of your father,
the so-called King of Failed Ventures?

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:05.050
How do you know about my father?!

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.970
You're too erratic.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:10.800
I had to look you up so that I could
understand what I'm up against.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:13.430
They say your father
was a crazy thrill-seeker

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:16.470
who ran around clearing
out dungeons everywhere.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:22.480
Yes. It made life unbearable
for my mother and me.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:24.730
Because of my father's refusal
to look after his family,

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:28.990
life was miserable until
I started working for Raiza'ha...

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:31.320
Live properly, work properly!

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.910
That's what being part
of society is all about!

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:37.240
Raiza'ha taught me
how wonderful it is to work!

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:41.750
How wonderful it is
to contribute to society!

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:45.250
That it's wrong for people
to live like my father!

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:48.550
That... That has to be true...

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:51.970
Or...

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:55.640
Calm down.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.850
What are you touching?!

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:06.570
Ouch... Anyway... I get the gist.

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:09.990
That must be why your personality
is paper-thin and always wavering.

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:10.940
Huh?

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:14.240
You say how the company
and work are so important,

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:17.490
but none of that is based on
your own personal determination.

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:22.290
You're just letting other people drive
your thoughts. That's why you're thin.

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:25.630
You're just working based
on a sense of duty.

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:27.170
No, I...

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:30.840
There's nothing inherently
wrong with work.

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:36.430
But right now, you're just brainwashed
by thoughts that benefit Raiza'ha.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:40.970
There's no need for you
to risk your life for them!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.350
Listen, Shia.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.850
You don't need to be bound by your father.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:48.690
You don't need to be the company's puppet!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:52.950
You're allowed to live in whatever
way you feel is right for you.

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:56.030
Be free, Shia.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:00.700
That was the back of the man
who always left me behind.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:05.210
But whenever dad left on his adventures...

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:08.840
He seemed so free and full of joy...

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:14.220
And that's what I loved about dad...

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:23.730
If you don't understand the meaning
of freedom, let me teach you!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.940
Begin plan three!

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:36.530
I stole some equipment from the company
just in case something like this happened!

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:40.330
This is how a man
supported by freedom fights!

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:41.830
That's horrible.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:44.080
What do you say, Shia.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:48.790
After such an elaborate setup,
don't you feel like you can go now?

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:52.130
Yes... I'll show you!

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:15.860
This is our... No, this is my victory!

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:19.450
For the great Ninomiya,
the Majin is like an insect!

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:23.580
This is a promised outcome,
an expected victory.

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:26.080
Speaking of expectations...

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:31.090
Yes, bosses do tend to revive once.

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:32.750
Ninomiya!

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:44.180
All part of the plan...
is what I might have said.

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:47.020
You sure did keep me in suspense there.

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:55.320
Kinji is my food. You can't
eat him without my permission.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:24.180
I have to admit,
I was pretty sure I was going to die.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.810
Thanks, Rim.

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:29.350
The Majin...
That's what I call real trouble.

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:32.270
No. That one was incomplete.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.860
What? What does that mean?

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:39.490
It wasn't born normally
because Rim went outside.

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:42.450
It was calling for help.

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:44.620
You're making even less sense.

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:49.040
Hey! Are you all right?! I'm on my way!

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.750
Yeah.

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:54.840
Well, at least we got through that.

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:57.800
Let's go grab some drinks for a change.

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:03.010
I'll let you eat whatever you want today.
What do you want?

00:22:03.010 --> 00:22:03.970
Meat.

00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:05.720
Eat your veggies.

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:08.310
Hmm? What's this? It's glowing.

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:10.230
I don't know.

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:14.150
Th-This is...

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:18.400
From that time...!
